+//!
+//! # SPIKE
+//!
+//! These aliases mirror the native n32 widths in `docs/spec/native-libc.md`
+//! §4.1.  They are re-exported by `std::os::unix::raw`, which only needs the
+//! nine types below.  `std::os::irix7::raw::stat` and the rest of the raw
+//! surface are left for the M9 `native-abi` crate.
+
+#![allow(deprecated)]
